      "q_en": "What was inside the thing Lucía found?",
      "a_en": "A lot of money, a photo and a number."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Por qué necesitaba Lucía el dinero?",
      "a": "Porque debía dinero de la casa y su hija necesitaba ropa nueva.",
      "q_en": "Why did Lucía need the money?",
      "a_en": "Because she owed money for the house and her daughter needed new clothes."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Qué le dijo su hermana?",
      "a": "Que el dinero era su suerte y que pensara en Sofía.",
      "q_en": "What did her sister tell her?",
      "a_en": "That the money was her luck and that she should think about Sofía."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Para qué era el dinero de Andrés?",
      "a": "Para un viaje: ir a ver a su hijo y a Tomás.",
      "q_en": "What was Andrés's money for?",
      "a_en": "For a trip: to go see his son and Tomás."
    },
    {
      "q": "¿Qué había en la carta que recibió Lucía?",
      "a": "Una foto nueva de Andrés y Tomás, y un trabajo para ella.",
      "q_en": "What was in the letter Lucía received?",
      "a_en": "A new photo of Andrés and Tomás, and a job for her."
    }
  ],
